[00:00.00] 作曲 : Joybeth Taylor/Jon Nite/Zachary Kale
[00:13.43] I got the whiskey
[00:13.43] 我手握威士忌
[00:16.92] She gets the good year bottle of wine
[00:16.92] 她却拥有年份上佳的葡萄酒
[00:20.57] I got the neon
[00:20.57] 我守着霓虹灯
[00:23.90] She gets the back porch strung up lights
[00:23.90] 她却拥有门廊串灯摇曳温柔
[00:27.61] I got the white lies, she gets the truth
[00:27.61] 我编织白色谎言 她听见真相
[00:31.02] She gets the version I wanted of you
[00:31.02] 她见到我理想中你的模样
[00:34.90]
[00:35.82] If I was good enough to be your last call
[00:35.82] 若我配得上做你深夜最后通话的人
[00:38.86] Why is she the one you call your mama about?
[00:38.86] 为何她能让你的母亲满心欢欣？
[00:42.98] After seein' all the b.s. I saw
[00:42.98] 目睹过所有荒唐事发生
[00:45.92] Why is she the one who sees your best side now?
[00:45.92] 为何如今是她见证你最美好的时分？
[00:49.24] If I'm the first thing on your mind
[00:49.24] 若她放手瞬间你便想起我
[00:52.77] The second she lets go
[00:52.77] 思绪即刻奔涌
